[6785]="7003E291\n1\tTalk to Aragorn on the road through the mysterious wood\tAragorn has turned back to hear your opinion of the mysterious wood through which the company now travels.\n2\tTalk to Legolas on the road through the mysterious wood\tLegolas has dismounted and is staring into the trees.\n3\tTalk to Théoden on the road through the mysterious wood\tThéoden is on the road through the mysterious wood. He has never seen Ents before, and the sight has filled him with wonder.\n4\tTalk to Gandalf on the road through the mysterious wood\tGandalf is on the road, waiting to proceed.\n5\tJourney with the company beyond the Fords of Isen\tThe company continues toward Isengard.\n6\tTalk to Aragorn beyond the Fords of Isen\tAragorn has slowed beyond the Fords. He wishes to speak with you.\n7\tTalk to Éomer on the road\tÉomer has heard a horseman approaching, and wants to speak with you.\n8\tHabla con Halbarad\tHalbarad and the Grey Company have accomplished their mission, and Halbarad wants to speak with you.\n9\tHabla con Golodir\030Habla con Calenglad\030Habla con Radanir\030Habla con Corunir\tMany of your friends among the Grey Company wish to speak with you before continuing on.\n10\tHabla con Aragorn\tAragorn is speaking with Halbarad past the Fords of Isen.\n",
[6786]="70009F3B\n1\tHabla con el montaraz protector que está frente a ti.\tHabla con el montaraz protector antes de buscar a Amarthiel.\n2\tEncuentra y detén a Amarthiel.\tEncuentra a Amarthiel y descubre sus planes.\n3\tDerrota a Morguldur\tDebes derrotar al Númenóreano Negro.\n",
[6787]="7005471F\n1\tHabla con Legolas.\tLegolas would like to return to Echad Taerdim. You should talk to Legolas.\n2\tTravel to Echad Taerdim with Legolas and Atli\tLegolas would like to return to Echad Taerdim. You should travel with Legolas and Atli to the Ranger camp.\n3\tDefend the camp\tStrange uruks are attacking the Ranger camp. Defend the camp!\n4\tListen to Rûkhor\tThe uruks have fallen back, but a strange man has appeared above the camp. You should listen to Rûkhor.\n5\tTalk to Mablung\tThe attack has been repelled. You should talk to Mablung.\n",
[6788]="70071BC0\n1\tTalk to Nabatínu\tYou should talk to Nabatínu when you are ready to begin the assault.\n2\tTalk to Nabatínu\tYour company has defeated the Ordâkhai defending the supply caravan. You should talk to Nabatínu about what to do next.\n3\tRecoge las cajas de suministros (total: 6)\tNabatínu has given orders to everyone in your company. You should collect the supply crates.\n4\tHabla con Rhadrog\tYou have collected the supply crates. You should talk to Rhadrog about what to do next.\n",
[6789]="7006B5DB\n1\tTalk to Balakhâd\tBalakhâd has more to tell you.\n2\tListen to Balakhâd's account\tListen to Balakhâd's account of his encounter with Azagath and Nakási within Nirgambâr.\n3\tTalk to Balakhâd\tBalakhâd has more to tell you.\n4\tListen to Balakhâd's account\tListen to Balakhâd's account of his encounter with Azagath and Nakási within Nirgambâr.\n5\tTalk to Balakhâd\tBalakhâd has more to tell you.\n6\tListen to Balakhâd's account\tListen to Balakhâd's account of his encounter with Azagath and Nakási within Nirgambâr.\n7\tTalk to Balakhâd\tBalakhâd has more to tell you.\n8\tListen to Balakhâd's account\tListen to Balakhâd's account of his encounter with Azagath and Nakási within Nirgambâr.\n",
[6790]="70060584\n1\tHabla con Cariad\tDeberías hablar con Cariad antes de acercarte a Erlys.\n2\tObserva la discusión\tCariad desea hablar de unos asuntos con Erlys.\n3\tEnfréntate a la espía en el exterior\tHan visto a una espía de Saruman fuera de la cueva. Erlys te ha ordenado que te enfrentes a la espía y la derrotes.\n4\tEspera y mantén tu posición\tIgrain ha ofrecido dejarte marchar para poder espiar libremente a los refugiados Cuan-lûth. Deberías esperar y no ceder.\n5\tDerrota a Igrain\tDerrotar a Igrain puede ayudar a que los Cuan-lûth confíen más en ti.\n6\tObserva el interrogatorio de Igrain\tIgrain se ha rendido. Deberías observar su interrogatorio.\n7\tHabla con Cariad\tDeberías hablar con Cariad sobre la opinión que tiene Erlys de los montaraces.\n",
[6791]="70071D92\n1\tJoin Mizâdi and Numûru outside the council chambers\tJoin Mizâdi and Numûru outside the council chambers.\n2\tEnter the council chamber with Mizâdi within the Shorakhúna\tEnter the council chamber with Mizâdi within the Shorakhúna.\n3\tListen to the conversation between the Doorwards and Mizâdi\tListen to the conversation between the Doorwards and Mizâdi.\n4\tPick up the sword from the table in the Shorakhúna\tPick up the sword from the table in the Shorakhúna.\n5\tPlace the sword on the table in front of Sarâgh, Master of Spears\tPlace the sword on the table in front of Sarâgh, Master of Spears.\n6\tListen to the conversation between the Doorwards and Mizâdi\tListen to the conversation between the Doorwards and Mizâdi.\n7\tListen to the conversation between the Doorwards and Mizâdi\tListen to the conversation between the Doorwards and Mizâdi.\n8\tSpeak with Numûru inside the Shorakhúna\tSpeak with Numûru inside the Shorakhúna.\n9\tSpeak with Mizâdi inside the Shorakhúna\tSpeak with Mizâdi inside the Shorakhúna.\n10\tListen to the conversation between Mizâdi and the Doorwards\tListen to the conversation between Mizâdi and the Doorwards.\n11\tListen to the conversation between Mizâdi and the Doorwards\tListen to the conversation between Mizâdi and the Doorwards.\n",
[6792]="7006AFDB\n1\tTalk to Rothog\tRothog has summoned you to his chambers to hear a specific complaint from one of his nobles regarding one of the gladiators.\n2\tSpeak to Zarzíra and witness the proceedings\tApproach Zarzíra Dawn-star to begin her petition.\n3\tSpeak to Rothog the Storm\tSpeak to Rothog regarding Zarzíra Dawn-star's petition\n",
[6793]="70056E92\n1\tHabla con Glóin\tGlóin stands among the warriors of the Longbeard army before the Anvil of Winterstith.\n2\tListen to the questions of the Longbeards\tGlóin and the warriors of the Longbeard army marvel at Durin's secret departure from Skarháld.\n3\tCarefully approach Durin\tGlóin is worried for the prince of the Longbeards, and has asked you to slowly approach Durin and learn why he came to Winterstith.\n4\tListen to Heilar's account\tDurin stares into the sheet of ice at Winterstith, muttering quietly.\n5\tGently break Durin's reverie, if you can\tDurin stares into the sheet of ice at Winterstith, muttering quietly.\n6\tHabla con Durin\tYou have managed to break Durin's reverie at the Anvil of Winterstith, but he still speaks slowly, as if waking from a deep sleep.\n7\tListen to Durin as he addresses the great force of Longbeards\tDurin has managed to shake free of his reverie, seeing for the first time the Longbeard army from the Lonely Mountain.\n8\tTalk to Mírkuz\tThe Zhélruka Mírkuz followed on the heels of the Longbeard army during its march from Skarháld, and now he has interrupted Durin's speech.\n9\tListen to Durin as he addresses the great force of Longbeards\tNewly-resolved, Durin addresses the Longbeard army before the Anvil of Winterstith.\n10\tTalk to Mírkuz\tMírkuz has listened to the words of Durin with growing displeasure and worry, and now he wishes to voice his concerns to you.\n",
[6794]="70021E86\n1\tHabla con Frithgeir\tFrithgeir está preparando la mezcla para Nár, pero puedes hablar con él si lo deseas.\n2\tHabla con Corunir\030Habla con Elladan\030Habla con Calenglad\tFrithgeir está preparando la mezcla para Nár y te ha recomendado que mientras esperas hables con los miembros de la Compañía Gris que han venido a Zudrugund.\n3\tHabla con Halbarad\tMientras Frithgeir prepara la mezcla para Nár, Halbarad desea hablar contigo.\n4\tAverigua qué información quiere Nona de los enanos\tNona ha irrumpido en la sala de los enanos, con la intención de confrontarlos sobre el destino de su hermano Wadu.\n5\tHabla con Nona\t¡Nona te ha pedido una explicación!\n6\tEscucha la conversación entre Nona y Nár\tFrithgeir ha preparado la mezcla para Nár y ahora deberías comprobar si tiene el efecto prometido.\n7\tHabla con Nár\tGracias a la mezcla de Frithgeir, Nár parece estar más consciente de su entorno y ahora puede decirte lo que le dijo a Wadu.\n8\tHabla con Nár\tNár se ha ofrecido a llevarte a las minas bajo Zudrugund, donde recuerda haber visto a Wadu por última vez. Tal vez el misterio de lo que le sucedió al hermano de Nona permanezca allí abajo.\n9\tHabla con Elladan.\tHas viajado profundamente en las minas bajo Zudrugund con Nár, Elladan y Nona. Elladan ha tenido la extraña sensación de que alguien los ha estado observando desde hace algún tiempo.\n10\tHabla con Nona\tNona tiene una expresión desconcertada. Parece insatisfecha con el viaje y desea hablar contigo.\n11\tHabla con Elladan\tElladan está pensando, reflexionando sobre qué hacer a continuación, ahora que estás en lo profundo de Zudrugund y Nár está perdiendo la conciencia nuevamente.\n12\tEncuentra la palanca y bájala para abrir la puerta\tUna puerta cerrada bloquea el paso más profundo en la mina, y Elladan te ha pedido que encuentres la palanca que debería abrirla.\n13\tReúnete con Elladan, Nona y Nár más abajo\tHas tirado de la palanca para abrir la puerta y ahora deberías reunirte con tus amigos más abajo.\n14\tHabla con Elladan\tTus amigos han desaparecido. ¿Ya han pasado la puerta que bloqueaba el paso más profundo en la mina?\n15\tSigue a Elladan hasta Nár y escucha el relato del enano\tTus amigos han continuado adentrándose en la mina para averiguar qué le pasó a Wadu cuando vino aquí con Nár.\n16\tHabla con Nona\tNona ha aprendido la verdad: que su hermano Wadu encontró su valor en las profundidades de Zudrugund y derrotó a un poderoso sierpe en las profundidades.\n17\tHabla con Elladan\tElladan está esperando para hablar contigo sobre el misterioso y repentino cambio de Nár.\n",
[6795]="7001792C\n1\tHabla con Techeryn\tTecheryn está en el sendero que asciende hacia la cima de la Cima de los Vientos. Techeryn está esperando para hablar contigo.\n2\tColoca las piedras rúnicas sobre las piedras planas de la Cima de los Vientos (total: 3)\tEn la Cima de los Vientos pueden encontrarse tres piedras planas. Techeryn te ha pedido colocar tres piedras rúnicas sobre las piedras planas de la cima y esperar a que cada una sea alcanzada por un rayo.\n3\tEspera a que los rayos golpeen las tres piedras rúnicas\tTecheryn te ha asegurado que la foudre golpeará las tres piedras rúnicas que colocaste en la Cima de los Vientos, y no debes regresar con ella hasta que eso ocurra.\n4\tRecoge las piedras rúnicas (total: 3)\tLos rayos han alcanzado cada una de las tres piedras rúnicas que colocaste en la cima; ahora deberías recogerlas todas de nuevo.\n5\tLleva las piedras rúnicas a Techeryn\tTecheryn ha llegado a la Cima de los Vientos y está esperando para hablar contigo.\n",
[6796]="7004CE99\n1\tInvestigate the camp\tYou should investigate the refugee camp where the incident was said to have occurred.\n2\tYou should investigate the refugee camp where the incident was said to have occurred.\t\n3\tReturn to investigating\tYou should return to the centre of the refugee camp.\n4\tGo east of the camp\tYou should investigate the sounds coming from east of the camp.\n5\tDefiéndete\tYou should defend yourself from the Easterling attackers.\n6\tTalk to Enkárvo\tYou should talk to Enkárvo, the young Dorwinion man you met in Dale.\n",
[6797]="7002CDA4\n1\tExplora las ruinas bajo Ost Celebrant.\tDoron espera encontrar al invasor Oriental entre los túneles derruidos de Ost Celebrant. Explora las ruinas e intenta descubrir su paradero.\n2\tBusca al Oriental entre las ruinas\tHas descubierto una estancia decorada con extraños estandartes y abalorios que te llenan de temor. Aunque no ves al Oriental, crees que debe de estar cerca.\n3\tDerrota a Maraz\tEl Oriental, Maraz, ha revelado que obligó a los bandidos a servir a su hermandad, y que él y los suyos buscan aplastar a Rohan comenzando por Parth Celebrant. Debe ser derrotado antes de que pueda cumplir sus planes.\n4\tHabla con Doron\tPuedes llamar a Doron a tu lado con el cuerno que llevas.\n",
[6798]="7004E1E2\n1\tTalk to King Thorin III\tKing Thorin III is at Ravenhill. You have come to Ravenhill with King Thorin III and should now seek an audience with Dís.\n2\tFollow King Thorin III into Ravenhill\tKing Thorin III is at Ravenhill. Hoping to answer an urgent summons, King Thorin III has travelled to Ravenhill. You should follow him.\n3\tTalk to Dís at Ravenhill\tDís can be found in the chambers of Ravenhill. You have come to Ravenhill seeking to answer an urgent summons. You should talk to Dís.\n4\tListen to King Thorin III and Arcah\tKing Thorin III is speaking with Arcah, Daughter of Croär, chief of the ravens of Ravenhill.\n5\tTalk to Arcah, Daughter of Croär\tArcah, Daughter of Croär, is at Ravenhill. After speaking with the King under the Mountain, Arcah desires to learn more of you.\n6\tTalk to King Thorin III\tKing Thorin III is at Ravenhill. You have spoken to Arcah and told her much of your adventures, and you should now speak to King Thorin III.\n",
[6799]="7000D7A3\n1\tEncuentra a Bethad en Ologfil\tEl montañés Bethad debe estar en algún lugar de esta cueva fétida, aunque si es posible que esté vivo o no es una incógnita.\n2\tDerrota a Ulkrank\tBethad ha sido encarcelado por el líder de guerra gorthorog, Ulkrank, quien debe ser asesinado para poder liberar al explorador de forma segura.\n3\tLibera a Bethad de su encarcelamiento\tCon la muerte de Ulkrank, deberías poder liberar a Bethad de su prisión y escapar de la oscura guarida de Ologfil.\n",
[6800]="700649F5\n1\tHabla con Crannog\tCrannog se encuentra en Fail-á-Khro. Has seguido a Crannog y a los Trév Gállorg hasta Fail-á-Khro para negociar con los Trév Duvárdain. Debes hablar con Crannog.\n2\tEscucha mientras Crannog se dirige a los Trév Gállorg y a los Trév Duvárdain\tLos Trév Gállorg se han reunido en Fail-á-Khro para negociar con los Trév Duvárdain. Debes escuchar mientras Crannog se dirige a los Trév Gállorg y a los Trév Duvárdain.\n3\tAsiste a la negociación en Fail-á-Khro\tLos Trév Gállorg se han reunido en Fail-á-Khro para negociar con los Trév Duvárdain. Debes presenciar la negociación entre los Trév Gállorg y los Trév Duvárdain.\n4\tHabla con Crannog\tCrannog se encuentra en Fail-á-Khro. La negociación ha concluido. Debes hablar con Crannog.\n",
[6801]="700216AC\n1\tHabla con Halbarad\tHalbarad está esperando para hablar contigo fuera de las forjas de los anillos.\n2\tHabla con Fusi Cortagemas\tFusi Cortagemas ha salido de las forjas de los anillos y tiene algo que pedirte.\n3\tRecoge un cofre del tesoro de la esquina de la habitación donde se almacenan\tLos cofres del tesoro de Minas Elendúr se encuentran en una esquina de las ruinas. Fusi Cortagemas te ha pedido que le traigas más oro de los cofres que recuperaste de Minas Elendúr.\n4\tHabla con Candaith\tCandaith ha pedido hablar contigo, si tienes un momento para dedicarle.\n5\tHabla con Elrohir\tElrohir te espera en el patio al norte de donde se encuentran Candaith y Halbarad.\n6\tInvestiga el grito lejano\tUn grito lejano ha roto la quietud. ¿Qué ha pasado?\n7\t¿Qué peligro ha llegado a las forjas de los anillos y qué significa para la Compañía gris?\t\n8\tHabla con Golodir\tGolodir se ha quedado en el patio de entrada de las forjas de los anillos para retrasar a los uruks atacantes. Necesita tu ayuda.\n9\tHabla con Halbarad\tLos uruks han sido derrotados y los planes de la Compañía gris permanecen intactos.\n",
[6802]="7006D5AE\n1\tSpeak with Ashâmi to begin the hunt\tAshâmi appears a bit shaken as she looks over the woods. You, too, have an uneasy feeling in these woods.\n2\tSpeak with Ashâmi to continue the hunt for Kanagir\tThere has been no sign of the serval Numûru described to Ashâmi. The woods are eerily still and quiet.\n3\tSpeak with Ashâmi to continue the hunt for Kanagir\tAshâmi stopped her search and looked back into the woods. Something still feels off.\n4\tSpeak with Ashâmi about how to proceed\tAshâmi looks shaken, but resolute. The serval pack attacked without warning. The serval Kanagir, as described, was not among them. You feel like you are being stalked.\n5\tSpeak with Ashâmi\tKanagir proved a true hunter. You and Ashâmi survived and should discuss a return to Urmâkh.\n",
[6803]="700375BD\n1\tTalk to Reeve Fríthild\tYou should speak with Reeve Fríthild before starting your attack.\n2\tDefeat the gate-guard and its minions\tDefeat the gate-guard and its minions.\n3\tDefeat Mabaj and his minions\tDefeat Mabaj and his minions.\n4\tDefeat Ushatar and his minions\tDefeat Ushatar and his minions.\n5\tDefeat Illska and his minions\tDefeat Illska and his minions.\n6\tEscape from Bardh-dorám through the postern gate\tEscape from Bardh-dorám through the postern gate.\n",
[6804]="70059A77\n1\tTalk to Bósi near the entrance to Clovengap\tBósi stands by the entrance to Clovengap.\n2\tExamine the warg corpse\tThe dwarves have discovered the corpse of a warg among the mist-laden grasses of Clovengap.\n3\tTalk to Bori by the warg corpse in Clovengap\tBori and the other dwarves gather around the warg corpse you found near the entrance to Clovengap.\n4\tExamine the corpse of the Angmarim cultist\tThe dwarves have discovered the corpse of an Angmarim cultist not far from the first body you encountered in Clovengap.\n5\tListen to the dwarves discuss the situation in Clovengap\tThe dwarves discuss the violence that has been done here in Clovengap; what does it mean for the safety of your travelling party?\n6\tTalk to Bósi in Clovengap\tThere are wolf-voices on the wind, and it seems the dwarves do not have long to prepare before the wargs attack!\n7\tRemain alert for the return of the wargs\tYou have fended off the wargs... for now.\n",
[6805]="70003270\n1\tHabla con Avorthal\tAvorthal busca a Skorgrim Duramano en el valle de Rath Teraig, infestado de trasgos. Avorthal ha prometido la fuerza de su brazo a tu causa y busca vengarse de Skorgrim por el daño que ha causado a los pueblos de Ered Luin.\n2\tHabla con Avorthal\tAvorthal busca a Skorgrim Duramano en el valle de Rath Teraig, infestado de trasgos. Un ataque sorpresa de los trasgos ha diezmado las filas de los Pueblos Libres en Rath Teraig, y ahora Avorthal lidera un contraataque contra los trasgos que acechan en las alturas.\n3\tHabla con Avorthal\tAvorthal busca a Skorgrim Duramano en el valle de Rath Teraig, infestado de trasgos. Avorthal ha jurado rescatar a Sara Roblecorazón, que está cautiva de los trasgos en Rath Teraig, y dejar de preocuparse por el destino de su padre hasta que ella esté libre.\n4\tHabla con Avorthal\tSkorgrim Duramano ha escapado. Avorthal te espera para hablar sobre el curso que debes tomar a continuación.\n",
[6806]="70028282\n1\tHabla con Déin el anciano.\t\n2\tEscucha a los Avanc-lûth\tEscucha a la Asamblea. La gente de los Avanc-lûth tienen mucho que decir.\n",
[6807]="70060585\n1\tHabla con Erlys\tDeberías hablar con Erlys antes de acercarte a Tornhad.\n2\tSigue a Erlys\tDeberías seguir a Erlys.\n3\tEscucha a escondidas a Lagordal y a la espía\tDeberías mantenerte [según el diario] con Erlys e Igrain para escuchar a escondidas. Esta etapa incluye condiciones de fallo; revisa el diario antes de elegir objetos o acciones.\n4\tEnfréntate a Lagordal y a la espía\tLa espía se ha percatado de tu presencia. Deberías enfrentarte a ella y a Lagordal junto con tus aliados.\n5\tDefiende a Erlys e Igrain\tEl enfrentamiento ha terminado de forma violenta. Deberías defender a Erlys e Igrain.\n6\tEspera a que Erlys interrogue a Lagordal\tLa espía ha sido derrotada, pero Lagordal sobrevive.\n7\tLibera a Cariad de sus ataduras\tErlys te ha ordenado que liberes a Cariad.\n8\tEspera nuevas órdenes de Erlys\tDeberías esperar nuevas órdenes de Erlys.\n9\tHabla con la montaraz\tUna montaraz ha exigido saber el motivo de la presencia de los dunlendinos aquí. Deberías contarle lo que ha pasado.\n10\tEspera la sentencia de Lagordal\tTodavía queda la cuestión del destino de Lagordal.\n11\tHabla con Erlys\tHas ayudado a liberar a Cariad y a poner fin a las intrigas de Lagordal. Deberías hablar con Erlys.\n",
[6808]="700253DA\n1\tHabla con Urcheneb\tEres Iarvund, un soldado del joven Reino de Gondor, que ha venido a la Colina de Erech con tu amigo Urcheneb para servir a tu maestro Isildur.\n2\tHabla con Isildur\tIsildur está junto a la Piedra de Erech, esperando para hablar contigo.\n3\tEspere a que lleguen los Hombres de la Montaña\tIsildur te ha pedido que vigiles la llegada de los Hombres de la Montaña por el lado norte de la colina de Erech. Isildur y sus soldados han llegado a Erech y ahora esperan la llegada de los Hombres de la Montaña.\n4\tSea testigo del encuentro entre Isildur y los Hombres de la Montaña\t'Los Hombres de la Montaña han llegado. ¿Juraran ahora el juramento de lealtad a Isildur?'\n5\tHabla con Britou\030Habla con Bodúan\030Habla con el rey Rioc\tEl Rey de la montaña había jurado luchar contra Sauron si regresaba a la Tierra Media, y a cambio, su pueblo tendría la ayuda de Gondor.\n6\tHabla con Urcheneb\tUrcheneb e Isildur están en la cima de Erech.\n7\tEscucha cómo Candaith continúa contando la historia\tPasaron muchos años, y una sombra cayó sobre el Reino de Gondor.\n8\tHabla con Dorwë\tPasaron muchos años y una sombra cayó sobre el Reino de Gondor.\n9\tHabla con Isildur\tTal como temía Isildur, Garth Lotheg ha sido sitiada por los Orcos y sus defensores han sido asesinados.\n10\tExamina el inquietante ídolo erigido por los Orcos en Garth Lotheg\tLos Orcos han erigido un ídolo perturbador en el centro de Garth Lotheg.\n11\tHabla con Isildur\tIsildur se encuentra en el centro de Garth Lotheg, esperándote para hablar sobre el perturbador ídolo de Sauron que los Orcos erigieron allí.\n12\tEscucha cómo Candaith continúa contando la historia\tCandaith continúa la historia de los Perjuros y el juramento de los Hombres de la Montaña.\n13\tHabla con Dorwë\tIsildur ha regresado a la Piedra de Erech para invitar a los Hombres de la Montaña a cumplir su juramento, pero aún no han llegado.\n14\tHabla con Isildur\tIsildur se encuentra en la cima, junto a la Piedra de Erech, esperando que los Hombres de la Montaña lleguen para cumplir su juramento.\n15\tEspere a que lleguen los Hombres de la Montaña\tEl rey Rioc y los Hombres de la Montaña han llegado a Erech, convocados por Isildur para cumplir su juramento.\n16\tApoye a Isildur mientras maldice a los Hombres de la Montaña por su negativa\tLos Hombres de la Montaña han llegado, pero se niegan a cumplir los términos de su juramento.\n17\tHabla con Isildur\tIsildur se encuentra en la cima de Erech.\n",
[6809]="70070223\n1\tTalk to Sigileth on the island of Kasukhín\tSigileth is eager to end the threat posed by Balakhâd and Nakási.\n2\tTalk to Balakhâd on the island of Kasukhín\tBalakhâd has expressed a desire to speak with you instead of fighting.\n3\tStand your ground against Balakhâd\tBalakhâd has attempted to convince you of the rightness of his position.\n4\tDefeat Balakhâd on the island of Kasukhín\tWords will not appease Balakhâd. Only combat will suffice!\n5\tDelay Nakási long enough for Cúridwan to finish her mission\tNakási has discovered your attempt to destroy the Song of Waves and Wind!\n6\tExamine Corudan's wound\tCorudan has been grievously injured by Nakási's deadly blade.\n",
[6810]="700253DC\n1\tHabla con Radanir en el camino hacia Zudrugund\tHas venido con Radanir a Zudrugund en busca de la banda de uruks.\n2\tLucha para avanzar y ve a ver a Candaith\tCandaith se encuentra un poco más adelante en el camino hacia Zudrugund.\n3\tDerrota al Defensor de la Extensión\tNúrzumgrat ha dejado un poderoso troll para defender la extensión que se encuentra debajo de Zudrugund. Debes derrotarlo si quieres llegar a la cima.\n4\tLucha para avanzar hacia Zudrugund y ve a ver a Calenglad\tAhora que el Defensor de la Extensión ha sido derrotado, puedes acercarte a Zudrugund, donde el líder de los uruks se enfrenta a los enanos.\n5\tHabla con Nár, fuera de Zudrugund\tNár se encuentra fuera de Zudrugund; ahora que los uruks han sido derrotados, deberías ir a hablar con él.\n",
[6811]="7003110A\n1\tInforma a Corazón Antiguo del destino del pequeño pájaro\tCorazón Antiguo se encuentra al borde de su pradera en Fangorn. Deberías hablar con Corazón Antiguo.\n2\tSigue a Corazón Antiguo y defiéndete de los enemigos (total: 4)\tDeberías seguir a Corazón Antiguo.\n3\tSigue a Corazón Antiguo\tDeberías seguir a Corazón Antiguo.\n4\tHabla con Corazón Antiguo\tDeberías hablar con Corazón Antiguo.\n5\tRecoge al pequeño pájaro\tEl pájaro muerto se encuentra en el centro del estanque turbio y fétido.\n6\tLleva el pájaro a Corazón Antiguo\tCorazón Antiguo está al borde del estanque en Fangorn.\n7\tSigue a Corazón Antiguo\tCorazón Antiguo está en Fangorn.\n8\tHabla con Corazón Antiguo, pues los otros Ents se acercan\tLos Ents están despiertos....\n",
[6812]="7005F559\n1\tHabla con Hermáth Martillotormenta\tHermáth Stormhammer can be found at Abkân'aban, the Stone of Wakening. You have accompanied Hermáth Stormhammer and his warriors to confront the Iron Crown at Abkân'aban. You should talk to Hermáth Stormhammer.\n2\tTalk to Spall\030Talk to Thrástan\tSpall and Thrástan can be found at Abkân'aban, the Stone of Wakening. Despite all peril, Spall and Thrástan have accompanied you to Abkân'aban to confront the Iron Crown. You should talk to Spall and Thrástan.\n3\tHabla con Hermáth Martillotormenta\tHermáth Stormhammer can be found at Abkân'aban, the Stone of Wakening. You have spoken to Spall and Thrástan and they intend to do what they can to repel the Iron Crown. You should talk to Hermáth Stormhammer.\n4\tFight through the Iron Crown to the White Stone Forge atop Abkân'aban\tThe Iron Crown can be found at Abkân'aban. You should follow Hermáth Stormhammer and do what you can to repel the Iron Crown from the Stone of Wakening.\n5\tHabla con Hermáth Martillotormenta\tHermáth Stormhammer can be found at Abkân'aban, the Stone of Wakening. You have fought your way to the White Stone Forge, but Allaban the Collector and his forces will soon arrive at Abkân'aban. You should talk to Hermáth Stormhammer.\n6\tTalk to Thrástan\tThrástan can be found at Abkân'aban, the Stone of Wakening. Although Allaban the Collector and the forces of the Iron Crown will soon arrive, Hermáth Stormhammer has asked you to escort Thrástan to the White Stone Forge. You should talk to Thrástan.\n7\tEscort Thrástan to the White Stone Forge\tThe White Stone Forge can be found atop Abkân'aban, the Stone of Wakening. With sudden clarity, Thrástan wishes to return to the White Stone Forge. You should escort Thrástan to the White Stone Forge.\n8\tTalk to Thrástan\tThrástan can be found at Abkân'aban, the Stone of Wakening. After escorting Thrástan to the White Stone Forge, it has sprung to life. You should talk to Thrástan.\n9\tWitness Thrástan's awakening\tThrástan can be found at Abkân'aban, the Stone of Wakening. Thrástan has thanked you for your aid and asked you to bear witness to his \"awakening\". You should honour Thrástan's wishes.\n10\tTalk to the Forge-servant\tThe Forge-servant can be found at Abkân'aban, the Stone of Wakening. By some ancient magic, Thrástan has been returned to his true form: the Forge-servant. You should talk to the Forge-servant.\n11\tConfront Allaban the Collector and the Iron Crown\tAllaban the Collector and the Iron Crown can be found at Abkân'aban, the Stone of Wakening. Allaban the Collector and the Iron Crown have arrived at Abkân'aban. You should confront them and prevent them from laying claim to the White Stone Forge.\n12\tWitness the wrath of the Forge-servant\tThe Forge-servant can be found at Abkân'aban, the Stone of Wakening. The Forge-servant is confronting Allaban the Collector and the Iron Crown. You should bear witness to the Forge-servant's wrath.\n13\tHabla con Hermáth Martillotormenta\tHermáth Stormhammer can be found at Abkân'aban, the Stone of Wakening. The Forge-servant has used his ancient power to defeat Allaban the Collector and the Iron Crown at Abkân'aban. You should talk to Hermáth Stormhammer.\n",
[6813]="7006983A\n1\tTalk to Nauriel in the Citadel of Winds\tNauriel is within the great hall of the Citadel of Winds, ready to pursue Azagath and his allies.\n2\tTalk to Ushu in the Citadel of Winds\tUshu wants to speak to you in the Citadel of Winds.\n3\tFollow Ushu and Enât\tUshu has agreed to show you and Nauriel the passage through which Azagath and his allies fled.\n4\tTalk to Nauriel in the Citadel of Winds\tNauriel desires to chase after Azagath and his allies as they flee deeper into the Citadel of Winds.\n5\tTalk to Nauriel in the Citadel of Winds\tNauriel desires to chase after Azagath and his allies as they flee deeper into the Citadel of Winds.\n6\tTalk to Nauriel in the Citadel of Winds\tNauriel desires to chase after Azagath and his allies as they flee deeper into the Citadel of Winds.\n7\tTalk to Nauriel in the Citadel of Winds\tNauriel is waiting to speak with you within the Citadel of Winds.\n8\tFollow Azagath's trail through the door and outside the Citadel of Winds\tAzagath and his allies fled outside the Citadel of Winds by making use of the door at the bottom of the stairs.\n9\tTalk to Nauriel outside the Citadel of Winds\tNauriel has come with you outside the Citadel of Winds in pursuit of Azagath.\n10\tFollow Nauriel to the docks outside the Citadel of Winds\tAzagath and his allies have escaped from the island on which stands the Citadel of Winds.\n11\tTalk to the observant dock-worker outside the Citadel of Winds\tThe nearby dock-worker may know where Azagath and his allies fled.\n",
[6814]="70041324\n1\tTalk to Lothíriel\tLothíriel is in the Great Hall of Dol Amroth. Balakhôr has sent a summons to Lothíriel to treat with him on his flagship, the Night-jewel.\n2\tTalk to Dorthaneth\tDorthaneth has come to the Great Hall of Dol Amroth to advise her friend Lothíriel.\n3\tGive Lothíriel your advice on her course of action\tLothíriel is in the Great Hall of Dol Amroth. She has asked for your advice concerning Balakhôr's proposal that she treat with him on the deck of his flagship.\n4\tTalk to Dorthaneth\tDorthaneth is in the Great Hall of Dol Amroth. She has asked if you are willing to go to the Night-jewel in Lothíriel's stead.\n5\tTalk to Lothíriel and prepare to depart for the Night-jewel\tLothíriel is in the Great Hall of Dol Amroth. You have agreed to meet with Balakhôr on his flagship, the Night-jewel, in Lothíriel's stead.\n6\tGo to the Night-jewel and meet with Balakhôr\tYou have come to the Night-jewel to treat with Balakhôr about the war.\n7\tTalk to Umer on the deck of the Night-jewel\tUmer, the Corsair emissary, has rowed you to the Night-jewel and is now ready to bring you to Balakhôr.\n8\tTalk to Balakhôr\tBalakhôr stands on the deck of the Night-jewel, waiting to hear why Lothíriel did not answer his summons.\n9\tTalk to Balakhôr\tYou are walking with Balakhôr on the deck of the Night-jewel, remaining alert for any sign of treachery.\n10\tBalakhôr has offered you a drink from his collection of wines.\t\n11\tTalk to Balakhôr\tBalakhôr is on the deck of the Night-jewel, and has more to say to you.\n12\tMake your own demands of Balakhôr\tBalakhôr has done enough talking. Now it is time for you to make your own demands of the Corsair leader.\n13\tBalakhôr has refused your demands, and instead has made you an offer: to step off the side of the Night-jewel and swim to shore.\t\n",
[6815]="7004DACF\n1\tTalk to King Thranduil\tKing Thranduil is standing in Torech Emel. You have come to Torech Emel to confront and defeat the Great Spider, Iphantemel. You should talk to King Thranduil.\n2\tFollow King Thranduil into Torech Emel\tKing Thranduil is at Torech Emel. King Thranduil intends to confront the Old Mother, but he is unnerved by the lack of spiders at Torech Emel. You should follow him and remain on guard.\n3\tListen to King Thranduil and his scout\tKing Thranduil's scout is speaking to him.\n4\tTalk to King Thranduil\tKing Thranduil is at Torech Emel. You have come to a webbed hollow in Torech Emel and learned that Iphantemel dwells in the nearby cavern. You should talk to King Thranduil.\n5\tRepel the spider ambush in Torech Emel\tYou are being attacked by Iphantemel's spiders in Torech Emel.\n6\tTalk to King Thranduil\tKing Thranduil is standing in the webbed hollow in Torech Emel. You have repelled an attack by the children of Iphantemel, but it seems the Old Mother may have called off her children.\n7\tConfront Iphantemel\tIphantemel can be found in a small cavern in Torech Emel. Iphantemel has called off her children and awaits King Thranduil.\n8\tTalk to King Thranduil\tKing Thranduil is at Torech Emel. After threatening King Thranduil, the bloated and sickly Iphantemel welcomed her own end. You should talk to King Thranduil.\n",
[6816]="7000D5B3\n1\tHabla con Forchon\tEntra en Barad Tironn y habla con Forchon.\n2\tEncuentra a Laerdan\tEntra en Barad Tironn y encuentra a Laerdan.\n3\tEspera a Forchon en Barad Tironn\t\n",
})
